        <item>
            <title>1.6</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:14:50 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Image clips: save screenshots and copied pictures. Turn on Save pictures I copy in Settings, or keep just one with Save Picture from Clipboard in the menu bar menu.</li>
<li>Paste as plain text anywhere with ⌥⇧⌘V.</li>
<li>Nothing you copy in a password manager is saved, even if the app doesn't mark it as secret.</li>
<li>Sync now reaches Clippy on Windows too, through iCloud Drive.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
