            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Clips | Boards tabs at the top of the clip list. The Boards tab lists every note on your boards, so you can read and edit them right there.</li>
<li>Resize board notes by dragging their bottom-right corner.</li>
<li>Quick Paste (⌥⌘V) no longer has an empty Colors column.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
